<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Heinz raised to long-term buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Heinz raised to long-term buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had raised its rating for H.J. Heinz Co to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage kept Heinz's rating of near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the food products company closed on Friday at 41-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
